<!-- VirgoX Elite GamingOS — Android 17 Local Manifest                              -->
<!-- Target: Motorola Moto G45 5G / G34 5G (fogos) — SM6375 / Holi                 -->
<!-- Maintainer: Prince · VirgoYT (VIRGOYT707)                                     -->
<!-- Base: LineageOS / Evolution X 12.1 — Android 17                                -->
